				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>nu, hob ikh genemen dos kind aheym un mir hobn zikh gemutshet. kh'hob zikh gemutshet, ober kh'hob gearbet, kh'hob zey VOSPITYVet, I VSЁ.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
