			<ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a429" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts961" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts962">
				<ANNOTATION_VALUE>nu, &lt;azoy&gt; s'iz gegangen di regns, &lt;azoy s'iz&gt; gefaln un aldings, di kinder zenen gevaksn bay mir sheyne tsvey tekhter. nu, vos zhe ken ikh nokhet zogn?</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
